    "updated_at": "2021-01-08T18:28:20Z",
    "body": "I'd also like to speed up prompt rendering by NOT calling my `when` and `command` snippets every single time.\r\n\r\nWould it be possible to add a `cooldown` optional int which would tell starship to cache the value for `cooldown` milliseconds?\r\nIf `cooldown` is specified, then starship would call `when` and `command` no more than every `cooldown` milliseconds, it would simply use last value returned by the custom section during that time.\r\n",
